SELECT ch.id, 'en',
  $body$The Man Who Came Out of the Sea$body$,
  $body$The storm broke his boat on the rocks, and the whole village watched a man walk out of the water with a sword on his back.

He wore a wooden mask. He did not take it off. He did not say one word, then or ever.

The fishermen expected trouble. The children hid behind the nets.

Only the village oracle looked pleased. Nerif was blind, and he saw things before they happened, and his visions were always true and almost never useful.

He had predicted a visitor. He had also predicted that the visitor would spend the summer doing laundry, which nobody took seriously, because the man coming up the beach looked like the end of the world.$body$
FROM public.story_chapter ch
JOIN public.story_issue i ON i.id = ch.issue_id
